## Challenge Attribution

All CTF challenges in this repository are from **Hack The Box (HTB)** events,
primarily from HTB CTF Try Out.

- **Challenge Source**: Hack The Box (https://www.hackthebox.com/), HTB CTF Try Out (https://ctf.hackthebox.com/event/1434)
- **Original Challenges**: © Hack The Box Ltd.
- **Solutions & Writeups**: © 2025 Om Gajjar

The challenges themselves are property of Hack The Box Ltd. This repository
contains educational writeups, solutions, and documentation created by the
author for learning purposes.

## Tools & Environment Attribution

Solutions in this repository were developed using:
- **Operating Systems**: Kali Linux (VMware), WSL Ubuntu
- **Security Tools**: Kali Linux toolset
- **Development Tools**: GitHub Copilot CLI, various AI assistants
- **Network Tools**: ngrok for tunneling
- **Reference Materials**: HTB Business CTF 2024 official repository
  (https://github.com/hackthebox/business-ctf-2024)

## Educational Use Disclaimer

This repository is intended for educational purposes only. The solutions and
techniques demonstrated here should only be used in authorized environments
such as CTF competitions, penetration testing with proper authorization, or
personal learning labs.

**Users are responsible for ensuring they comply with all applicable laws and
regulations when using the information contained in this repository.**

## Challenge Status

Most challenges have been solved and documented. Some challenges may be marked
as "In Progress" or incomplete and are being actively worked on.

